    <string name="RegramDocSettingsInfo">Native integration of Doc Viewer 2.0.0 by Daxo-Developer / @Daxo_OS, without hooks or plugin loading. Disabled by default. Office documents and books are text previews, not full-fidelity page layouts. HTML cannot run scripts, navigate or load external/local resources. Archives are listed only: nothing is extracted. Supported image formats depend on Android. Invalid or oversized files show an error; you can explicitly choose another app. Existing file handlers, themes and plugin installation are retained. Protected documents cannot be copied or shared from this viewer.</string>
